@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api/auth

### Register
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "orgName": "Test Org"
}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login with wrong password
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### Get current user (replace TOKEN with a real access token from a login response above)
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Refresh (requires the browser/REST Client to have the refreshToken cookie from a prior login)
POST {{baseUrl}}/refresh

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/logout